====== Lemaker Banana Pi ======

The board is available from various vendors, including the manufacturer itself, see [[http://lemaker.org/|here for BananaPi]].

For further Allwinner-based boards, please refer to [[docs:techref:hardware:soc:soc.allwinner.sunxi|soc.allwinner.sunxi]]


